{"id":"99514e5366b81866","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-regular-reversal.md","title":"73-thm-regular-reversal — regular reversal","display":"73-thm-regular-reversal — regular reversal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-regular-reversal","display":"73-thm-regular-reversal — regular reversal","depends_on":["[[73-df-regular-language-notation]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-thm-regular-language-operations]]"],"aliases":["73-thm-regular-reversal","73-theorem-1.6"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-regular-reversal"},{"key":"display","html":"73-thm-regular-reversal — regular reversal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a2d140de13ec8897\" href=\"?note=a2d140de13ec8897\" title=\"73-df-regular-language-notation\">73-df-regular-language-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa8bbf232c5a7ab8\" href=\"?note=aa8bbf232c5a7ab8\" title=\"73-thm-regular-language-operations\">73-thm-regular-language-operations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-regular-reversal</span><span>73-theorem-1.6</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\">\\(L_1\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a2d140de13ec8897\" href=\"?note=a2d140de13ec8897\" title=\"73-df-regular-language-notation\">73-df-regular-language-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w^R\">\\(w^R\\)</span> 由词反向递归定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.6}\\vdash\n\\varepsilon^R\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad(wa)^R\\coloneqq aw^R,\\qquad\nL_1^R\\coloneqq\\{w^R:w\\in L_1\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.6}\\vdash\n\\varepsilon^R\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad(wa)^R\\coloneqq aw^R,\\qquad\nL_1^R\\coloneqq\\{w^R:w\\in L_1\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.6}\\vdash\nL_1^R\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.6}\\vdash\nL_1^R\\in\\mathrm{REGULAR}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-regular-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a2d140de13ec8897","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · d